.PP
specific version that only works for line elements in a two dimensional model Computes multiphase flow parameters for the finite volumes associated with the line elements of the lower-dimensional region associated with the sand properties object\&.

.PP
\fBAttention\fP
.RS 4
method must be called after the standard multiphase properties were calculated because it uses these property values\&. 
